		{
			"id":"24a5f449d1fafe29",
			"type":"file",
			"file":"Notes/Тримминг.md",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"border":null
			},
			"x":-880,
			"y":2100,
			"width":300,
			"height":400
		},
		{
			"id":"4dc370909466b246",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **Необходимые пакеты**\n\n```R\nlibrary(tidyverse)\nlibrary(phyloseq)\nlibrary(vegan)\nlibrary(DESeq2)\nlibrary(dendextend)\nlibrary(viridis)\n```\n",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":"database",
				"border":null,
				"textAlign":"center"
			},
			"x":1120,
			"y":4240,
			"width":420,
			"height":605,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"9d3f202c1d9060cc","type":"file","file":"Notes/Phyloseq.md","subpath":"#Альфа разнообразие","x":-3880,"y":5240,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"fd5e27090c4d464e","type":"file","file":"Notes/Chao1 & Shannon.md","x":-3360,"y":5240,"width":600,"height":560},
		{"id":"bbdd61da44f66328","type":"file","file":"_.Settings/Media/Pasted image 20260424111448.png","x":-3880,"y":5888,"width":400,"height":302},
		{"id":"955fdc06d84cf58e","type":"file","file":"_.Settings/Media/Pasted image 20260424111910.png","x":-4360,"y":5890,"width":399,"height":300},
		{
			"id":"89d1dfbe943ae767",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```R\nplot_richness(ASV_physeq, x=\"type\", color=\"char\", measures=c(\"Chao1\", \"Shannon\")) + \n    scale_color_manual(values=unique(sample_info_tab$color[order(sample_info_tab$char)])) +\n    theme_bw() + theme(legend.title = element_blank(), axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 90, vjust = 0.5, hjust = 1))\n    \n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4360,
			"y":5740,
			"width":400,
			"height":120
		},
